msgstr "Aktifkan logging INFO {#enable-info-logging}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because more work now happens on the client side, it's useful to see the progress of that\n"
"processing. Enable INFO-level logging for the `qiskit_ibm_runtime` logger:\n"
msgstr ""
"Karena lebih banyak pekerjaan sekarang terjadi di sisi klien, akan berguna untuk melihat progres dari pemrosesan\n"
"tersebut. Aktifkan logging level INFO untuk logger `qiskit_ibm_runtime`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform explicit noise learning for PEA and PEC {#perform-explicit-noise-learning-for-pea-and-pec}"
msgstr "Lakukan pembelajaran noise eksplisit untuk PEA dan PEC {#perform-explicit-noise-learning-for-pea-and-pec}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The new Estimator no longer performs *implicit* noise learning when the PEA or PEC error\n"
"mitigation method is selected. You must learn the noise models explicitly and pass them\n"
"in. Use the new [`NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) to control how circuits\n"
"are stratified into layers. It takes a list of boxed circuit instructions (for example,\n"
"the unique layers) as input.\n"
msgstr ""
"Estimator baru tidak lagi melakukan pembelajaran noise *implisit* ketika metode mitigasi error PEA atau PEC\n"
"dipilih. Kamu harus mempelajari model noise secara eksplisit dan memberikannya.\n"
"Gunakan [`NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) yang baru untuk mengontrol bagaimana circuit\n"
"distratifikasi menjadi layer. Ia menerima daftar instruksi circuit yang di-box (misalnya,\n"
"layer unik) sebagai input.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"PEA and PEC now **require** this explicit pattern. Do not skip the noise-learning step\n"
"or your code will fail. Measurement noise learning for TREX is unaffected and continues to work as before.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Penting\">\n"
"PEA dan PEC sekarang **mengharuskan** pola eksplisit ini. Jangan lewati langkah pembelajaran noise\n"
"atau kodemu akan gagal. Pembelajaran noise pengukuran untuk TREX tidak terpengaruh dan terus bekerja seperti sebelumnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, if your code uses `NoiseLearner` and passes the resulting noise model to server-side Estimator, you need to [migrate to `NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/migrate-to-noise-learner-v3). Do NOT use the older `NoiseLearner`, which is incompatible with the new Estimator.\n"
msgstr "Begitu juga, jika kodemu menggunakan `NoiseLearner` dan memberikan model noise hasilnya ke Estimator sisi server, kamu perlu [migrasi ke `NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/migrate-to-noise-learner-v3). JANGAN gunakan `NoiseLearner` versi lama, yang tidak kompatibel dengan Estimator baru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
