# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test locally with a fake backend {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"
msgstr "Uji secara lokal dengan fake backend {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting to hardware, you can validate the migrated code against a `Fake*`\n"
"backend to catch any syntax errors early. Note the following details about local testing mode:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum mengirim ke hardware, kamu bisa memvalidasi kode hasil migrasi terhadap backend `Fake*`\n"
"untuk menangkap error sintaks lebih awal. Perhatikan detail berikut tentang mode pengujian lokal:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**It does not reproduce hardware results.** Local noisy simulation does not perfectly\n"
"replicate real device noise, and therefore the outputs might differ. Running does validate\n"
"that the option paths and value types are correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ini tidak mereproduksi hasil hardware.** Simulasi noisy lokal tidak sepenuhnya\n"
"mereplikasi noise perangkat nyata, sehingga output mungkin berbeda. Menjalankannya tetap memvalidasi\n"
"bahwa jalur opsi dan tipe nilai sudah benar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `NoiseLearnerV3` has **no local testing mode**: its `mode` accepts only a real `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, or `Batch`, so you cannot exercise the noise-learning step against a fake\n"
"backend. Verify that part of your code against the\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3) instead. Confirm that the constructor,\n"
"the `run(instructions)` input shape, and any helper (such as the unique-layer helper) are\n"
"used as documented.\n"
msgstr ""
"- `NoiseLearnerV3` **tidak memiliki mode pengujian lokal**: `mode`-nya hanya menerima `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, atau `Batch` yang asli, sehingga kamu tidak bisa menjalankan langkah pembelajaran noise terhadap fake\n"
"backend. Sebagai gantinya, verifikasi bagian kode tersebut terhadap\n"
"[referensi API `NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3). Pastikan bahwa constructor,\n"
"bentuk input `run(instructions)`, dan helper apa pun (seperti helper unique-layer) digunakan\n"
"sesuai dokumentasi.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuit for efficient local simulation {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"
msgstr "Cliffordisasi circuit untuk simulasi lokal yang efisien {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A fake backend uses a statevector (noisy) simulator, whose cost grows exponentially with\n"
"qubit count and depth. Thus, a realistic workload circuit can hang or exhaust memory. Since\n"
"local testing only needs to exercise the option paths (not reproduce physical results),\n"
"reduce the circuit to a Clifford one first with\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"which rounds each `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` angle to the nearest multiple of π/2. Clifford circuits\n"
"simulate efficiently (stabilizer simulation) regardless of size.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fake backend menggunakan simulator statevector (noisy), yang biayanya tumbuh secara eksponensial seiring dengan\n"
"jumlah qubit dan depth. Akibatnya, circuit workload yang realistis bisa hang atau menghabiskan memori. Karena\n"
"pengujian lokal hanya perlu menjalankan jalur opsi (bukan mereproduksi hasil fisik),\n"
"kurangi circuit menjadi circuit Clifford terlebih dahulu dengan\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"yang membulatkan setiap sudut `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` ke kelipatan terdekat dari π/2. Circuit Clifford\n"
"dapat disimulasikan secara efisien (simulasi stabilizer) berapa pun ukurannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ConvertISAToClifford` **requires an ISA circuit** as input (the output of\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` targeting the backend). You must account for the following consequences\n"
"when constructing the local PUB:\n"
msgstr ""
"`ConvertISAToClifford` **memerlukan circuit ISA** sebagai input (output dari\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` yang menargetkan backend). Kamu harus memperhitungkan konsekuensi berikut\n"
"saat membuat PUB lokal:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The `.layout` attribute is dropped.** The Cliffordized circuit keeps the same qubit\n"
"count, but `clifford.layout` is `None`, so `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`\n"
"fails. Lay the observable out from the **pre-Clifford ISA** circuit instead:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, then run `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Atribut `.layout` dihilangkan.** Circuit yang telah di-Cliffordisasi mempertahankan jumlah qubit\n"
"yang sama, tetapi `clifford.layout` bernilai `None`, sehingga `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`\n"
"gagal. Sebagai gantinya, terapkan layout pada observable berdasarkan circuit ISA **sebelum Cliffordisasi**:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, lalu jalankan `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Parameters are bound away.** Rounding the rotation angles turns a parametric ISA circuit\n"
"into a concrete Clifford one, so `clifford.num_parameters` becomes `0`. A PUB that still\n"
"carries a parameter-values array fails coercion. For the local run, drop the parameter\n"
"array from the PUB; the hardware run keeps the original parametric circuit and its values.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Parameter hilang karena sudah terikat ke nilai tetap.** Pembulatan sudut rotasi mengubah circuit ISA parametrik\n"
"menjadi circuit Clifford konkret, sehingga `clifford.num_parameters` menjadi `0`. PUB yang masih\n"
"membawa array nilai parameter akan gagal saat coercion. Untuk run lokal, hilangkan array\n"
"parameter dari PUB; run hardware tetap menggunakan circuit parametrik asli dan nilainya.\n"

